@base = http://localhost:3000
@taskId = paste-the-id-from-create-response-here

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List tasks
GET {{base}}/tasks

### Create a task
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Learn Docker"}

### Mark the task complete (set taskId above first)
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"completed":true}

### Delete the task
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

### App version
GET {{base}}/version
